inspect_ia_agents (AgentRail) -- runtime governance + recette bench for AI agents.

This product re-homes (adapts, does not vendor wholesale) proven mechanisms from
the following open-source projects into its own architecture. Attribution is
preserved per their licenses.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
cyberark/agentwatch -- Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/cyberark/agentwatch
  Adapted: the in-process interception MECHANISM for observing an agent's LLM and
  tool calls. Re-homed in recette/capture/ as an LlmBackend wrapper
  (CapturingLlm), feeding this project's existing surface-recording and
  proxy-trace seams. No agentwatch source is vendored; the mechanism is
  reimplemented against this codebase's interfaces.
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
tensorstax/agenttrace -- MIT License
  https://github.com/tensorstax/agenttrace
  Adapted: the enriched per-call trace FIELD SET (LLM/tool call + tokens +
  latency + error + session). Re-homed in recette/capture/llm_trace.py and the
  existing ProxyTrace recorder. No agenttrace source is vendored.
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
